        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Greedy/mission_raccoon/scene_raccoon_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository ea42e21d-791c-4d70-b8f6-f2e26edbfe37).Image",
        "Description": "Marrakech was a close one, 47. Clearly framing ourselves wasn&apos;t my brightest idea. Now the ICA and The Silver Senate are at war. We know almost nothing, however, while imprissoned by the Senate, Sayid Laham managed to pick up some information. One of their many plans is robbing the Milton-Fitzpatrick bank. Prevent this. This should be quite easy, 47. Their team is not very professional. While you&apos;re at it, wear their disguise if you kill one of them. It might result in a war within the Senate.",
